From a.p.beckerman at stir.ac.uk  Mon May 13 11:52:21 2002
From: a.p.beckerman at stir.ac.uk (Andrew Beckerman)
Date: Mon, 13 May 2002 12:52:21 +0100
Subject: lme df and anova (summary)
